    <summary>ShareX fork with HDR to SDR conversion support</summary>
    <description>ShareX-HDR is a fork of [ShareX](https://github.com/ShareX/ShareX) that adds HDR to SDR conversion capabilities.

ShareX is a free and open source program that lets you capture or record any area of your screen and share it with a single press of a key. This fork adds support for HDR to SDR conversion based on contributions from the community.

## Credits
- ShareX-HDR is created and maintained by [GotoFinal](https://github.com/GotoFinal).
- It is based on [ShareX](https://github.com/ShareX/ShareX) by the ShareX Team. All credit for the original application goes to them.

## Features
- HDR to SDR conversion
- All original ShareX features including screenshot capture, screen recording, file uploading and more

## Notes
- This is a community fork and is provided as-is
- This package is not maintained by GotoFinal or the ShareX Team
- For support, please refer to the [GitHub repository](https://github.com/GotoFinal/ShareX-HDR)
    </description>
